Christian Pure prayers and article list

The files in data/seed/packs/ (prayers-finder.json, prayers-aloud.json and
llms.txt) are copyright Christian Pure, christianpure.com. They are the same
prayers and article list published on christianpure.com.

You may keep and share them unchanged as part of this app, so that it works
without an internet connection. They are not covered by the MIT licence that
covers the code. To use them for anything else, write to admin@christianpure.com.

The app refreshes these files from christianpure.com once a week when it can.

Other data:
- data/src/bsb.tsv.gz: Berean Standard Bible, public domain (berean.bible).
- data/src/topics.tsv.gz: topical Bible data from OpenBible.info, licensed
  CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), combined with the
  verses chosen on Christian Pure's verse pages.
